# Reaches Rebel's package `jose`, so that `heroes test` on this file runs the
# tests of its face, its private modules and the floors under them (spec
# § 12). It prints the JOSE name of the algorithm a JWT signed with an
# RSA key most often names, `RS256`, on every run, touching no key.

use <rebel>/jose

function main()
    print(jose.format_algorithm(.rs256))
